    pri=['Treat the low now by mouth: 15 g, recheck in 15 minutes, repeat until 70 or more, then a snack.', 'Safety: keep her in bed or assist to the bathroom while shaky; bed alarm; change the damp gown; comfort her mother.', 'Call the provider (protocol), recheck at 0400, teach her the signs and the rule of 15 while she lives it.'],
    S='Nora Whitcombe, SD-6: glucose 58 at the 0300 check; hard to rouse for a moment, now oriented and swallowing. I gave 16 g of glucose tablets at 0302.',
