    nxt='Juice 0318; recheck 0333; snack 0335; recheck 0400; dry gown; bed alarm; teach her and her mother the rule of 15.',
    pred='Any reasoned guess. What happens: she sleeps until 0630 with glucose 118 at 0400, and at 0700 she is ready to learn but makes a pen error and has a sick-day misconception.',
