        'Sick-day rules: never stop basal insulin; check glucose and ketones every 2-4 h; sugar-free fluids every hour (carbohydrate fluids if not eating); call for vomiting, moderate ketones or glucose over 300 twice; ED for vomiting with ketones, fast breathing or belly pain.',
